<body>
    <h1>03 User Story 1 - Delete Address Data</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 local-id=3D"59c0dbb39d9a" id=3D"id-03UserStory1-DeleteAddressDa=
ta-Description"><strong>Description</strong></h1>
<p local-id=3D"d9991aa1dbce">As a user, I want to permanently delete a part=
ner's existing address to remove incorrect, outdated, or no longer needed a=
ddress information from the system.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"a87f7063-8161-46a4-aba5-4277d3645545">
<h1 local-id=3D"b4aaaf57d3cf" id=3D"id-03UserStory1-DeleteAddressData-Addit=
ionalInformation"><strong>Additional Information</strong></h1>
<p local-id=3D"f4058568a680">The address data is located in the <strong>Add=
ress Data</strong> section within the partner module.</p>
<p local-id=3D"aa9cec2eec09">The user can open or close this section using =
the <strong>chevron</strong>.</p>
<p local-id=3D"795c93d19dbe">Each address is displayed as a <strong>compact=
 address card</strong>, e.g., <em>=E2=80=9CMailbox 1234, 12345 Sample City=
=E2=80=9D</em>.</p>
<p local-id=3D"59ea92bd0366">For each address, a burger menu containing the=
 following actions is available:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"ec6a8b06-5277-46bc-9891-4f96b6ecb539">
<li local-id=3D"f1b8a54e-8c72-45b1-95db-023582be5868">
<p local-id=3D"339828405f39"><strong>Edit</strong> (see <a data-card-appear=
ance=3D"inline" href=3D"https://iss-soprasteria.atlassian.net/wiki/x/QoArFQ=
" local-id=3D"2d605f1d6b56" rel=3D"nofollow">https://iss-soprasteria.atlass=
ian.net/wiki/x/QoArFQ</a>)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6fd06880-fc96-415f-8cf4-f36436eea215">
<p local-id=3D"4cda4610c07a"><strong><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" =
data-ref=3D"f0146b89-72b5-4aa5-97b1-d85dbc0be8bb">Delete</span></strong></p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"886099a7-68a6-4c80-aa25-823a887786c9">
<p local-id=3D"ca75c61cd047"><strong>Relocation</strong> (see <a data-card-=
appearance=3D"inline" href=3D"https://iss-soprasteria.atlassian.net/wiki/x/=
YwAsJg" local-id=3D"b7ac61ec-81c3-4798-b16e-300a3d785fc3" rel=3D"nofollow">=
https://iss-soprasteria.atlassian.net/wiki/x/YwAsJg</a>)</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"fd852a05-86d9-4e92-9bcf-7d48e6962a2d">
<h1 local-id=3D"4fe535ebbd4e" id=3D"id-03UserStory1-DeleteAddressData-Accep=
tanceCriteria"><strong>Acceptance Criteria</strong></h1>
<ul local-id=3D"ec27799f1c52">
<li local-id=3D"3d2518cae823">
<p local-id=3D"86436c54c73e">Clicking the <strong>Delete</strong> action in=
 the burger menu initiates the deletion process.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1cc1e6abf754">
<p local-id=3D"1dc437143960">Delete action is available only for current an=
d future reference dates.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cfb54ca29452">
<p local-id=3D"8f4196423588">When the selected address is <strong>not</stro=
ng> a default address, a confirmation pop=E2=80=91up dialogue is displayed =
with the following message:</p>
<p local-id=3D"849526745048"><strong>=E2=80=9C<span style=3D"background-col=
or: rgb(198,237,251);">Delete the address?</span></strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"244522fd7d33"><strong><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(1=
98,237,251);"> </span></strong><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(198,237=
,251);">&lt;compact address&gt; will be permanently deleted</span><strong>=
=E2=80=9D</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"ba8a18deb190">
<li local-id=3D"fc6ddf4b3d91">
<p local-id=3D"7f3772a51d6e">Below this message, options to Cancel or Confi=
rm the deletion are available.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bd063c43-68fb-4e35-a47d-682be1a2c35a">
<p local-id=3D"ff3150d0b2bd">The user can abort the process by clicking =E2=
=80=9C<strong>Cancel=E2=80=9D,</strong> or confirm the deletion by clicking=
 <strong>=E2=80=9CYes, delete=E2=80=9D</strong>.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"091ec64de1c9">
<p local-id=3D"fc9d8d5d0b53">When the selected address is the default addre=
ss and other addresses exist, a pop=E2=80=91up dialogue is displayed with t=
he following message:</p>
<p local-id=3D"260502315890">=E2=80=9C<strong><span style=3D"background-col=
or: rgb(198,237,251);">Replace Default Address</span></strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"6f277408b9e8"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(198,237,2=
51);">&lt;compact address&gt; is currently the default address. Please choo=
se a different address as the default.</span>=E2=80=9D</p>
<ul local-id=3D"aa640affc684">
<li local-id=3D"e5befbb09307">
<p local-id=3D"14374b698399">A dropdown titled <strong>=E2=80=9CNew Default=
 Address=E2=80=9D</strong> is displayed, allowing the user to select anothe=
r address of the partner to set as the default.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9cd717799a48">
<p local-id=3D"4ff3b0235ad3">The dropdown lists all other addresses of the =
partner, excluding the address to be deleted.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6cf46e13e5c7">
<p local-id=3D"001908d05c4e">The user can confirm the deletion and default =
address change by clicking <strong>=E2=80=9CDelete &amp; Replace Default=E2=
=80=9D</strong>, or cancel the operation by clicking <strong>=E2=80=9CCance=
l=E2=80=9D</strong>.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"d48dae1b-4681-41d3-8970-981d6079e300">
<p local-id=3D"fea007139422">When the selected address is the only address =
of the partner, a pop=E2=80=91up dialogue is displayed with the following m=
essage:</p>
<p local-id=3D"770fc7c316d8">=E2=80=9C<strong><span style=3D"background-col=
or: rgb(198,237,251);">Delete the only address?</span></strong></p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"1277c40a885e" style=3D"margin-left: 30.0px;"><span style=3D"=
background-color: rgb(198,237,251);">&lt;compact address&gt; is the only ad=
dress. Do you want to delete it?</span>=E2=80=9D</p>
<ul local-id=3D"c88f9c21-6059-48f9-a8e8-01f2c89b5123">
<li local-id=3D"80b78669-9f40-4e3f-b861-f3d1b14fb831">
<p local-id=3D"5ca36c16f214">The user can confirm the deletion by clicking =
<strong>=E2=80=9CYes, delete=E2=80=9D</strong>, or cancel the operation by =
clicking <strong>=E2=80=9CCancel=E2=80=9D</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dca4415a-6bbb-4e0d-a9d1-3d9161aee871">
<p local-id=3D"0158774095ed">The address is permanently removed from the sy=
stem only after confirmation.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"626a37104824">
<p local-id=3D"5d7e3133fe78">Deletion is irreversible.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ca1ab1aa-13c6-47ab-a246-7af55c808b61">
<p local-id=3D"71f21daf025a">After deletion, the address is removed immedia=
tely from the address overview.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4b491ee9-de17-41fb-9898-6fc89b08084d">
<p local-id=3D"cf73c1d2628c">The deletion creates a new session/version, wh=
ich is visible in the <strong>Change History </strong>(see <a data-card-app=
earance=3D"inline" href=3D"https://iss-soprasteria.atlassian.net/wiki/x/FQC=
PHg" local-id=3D"47929f77187e" rel=3D"nofollow">https://iss-soprasteria.atl=
assian.net/wiki/x/FQCPHg</a>).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"233521ba-2123-4f08-8dd2-f09ae4815628">
<p local-id=3D"4f9df502f080">If the user cancels the process at any stage, =
no changes are made.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"2b4480d7-4898-4306-bd06-efa0a5fc15aa">
<h1 local-id=3D"c280ed0fddab" id=3D"id-03UserStory1-DeleteAddressData-Alter=
nativeFlows"><strong>Alternative Flows</strong></h1>
<h3 local-id=3D"ac1765413a7e" id=3D"id-03UserStory1-DeleteAddressData-Userc=
ancelsthedeletion"><strong>User cancels the deletion</strong></h3>
<p local-id=3D"46243b8da6cf">The user clicks the Delete action but cancels =
the dialogue via <strong>Cancel</strong>. The address remains unchanged.</p=
>
<h3 local-id=3D"b1faee7c38f7" id=3D"id-03UserStory1-DeleteAddressData-Addre=
ssdeletedbyanotheruser"><strong>Address deleted by another user</strong></h=
3>
<p local-id=3D"645a50e66cad">The user attempts to delete an address that ha=
s already been removed in the background.<br>
After confirmation, the system refreshes the view and the address is no lon=
ger displayed.<br>
No deletion process occurs since the address no longer exists.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"81946eda5664" id=3D"id-03UserStory1-DeleteAddressData-Brows=
erclosedbeforeconfirmation"><strong>Browser closed before confirmation</str=
ong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"cf9a7af19cbf">
<li local-id=3D"310dd15c61e1">
<p local-id=3D"70abdd9b8cf1">The user initiates the deletion process but cl=
oses the browser before confirming the action.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f48f48826964">
<p local-id=3D"97e6c5c7aeb0">No deletion takes place.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"e4cb2644e4a5" id=3D"id-03UserStory1-DeleteAddressData-Attem=
pttodeleteadefaultaddress"><strong>Attempt to delete a default address</str=
ong></h3>
<p local-id=3D"1293c4c448ec">When the user attempts to delete a default add=
ress, the system prompts them to select another address as the default. Del=
etion is allowed only after a new default address is selected. If the defau=
lt address is the only address, deletion is allowed after confirmation.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"59eced78-7b08-4c4d-b80d-7f1a7bb6f580">
<h1 local-id=3D"8dbac68d84e1" id=3D"id-03UserStory1-DeleteAddressData-TestD=
ata"><strong>Test Data</strong></h1>
<h3 local-id=3D"f3b09be790fd" id=3D"id-03UserStory1-DeleteAddressData-Stand=
ardCase"><strong>Standard Case</strong></h3>
<p local-id=3D"aa49127e6f2d">The user opens the burger menu of a non=E2=80=
=91default address for a partner with multiple addresses and clicks the Del=
ete action. The confirmation dialogue appears, and the user confirms the de=
letion.<br><strong>Expected Result: </strong>The address is permanently del=
eted and immediately removed from the overview.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"8cf4934e09d0" id=3D"id-03UserStory1-DeleteAddressData-Alter=
nativeCase:Usercancels"><strong>Alternative Case: User cancels</strong></h3=
>
<p local-id=3D"872748504696">The user clicks the Delete action but cancels =
the operation in the pop=E2=80=91up dialogue.<br><strong>Expected Result: <=
/strong>All addresses remain unchanged in the Address Data section.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"52528b2a891c" id=3D"id-03UserStory1-DeleteAddressData-Alter=
nativeCase:Defaultaddress(Multipleaddresses)"><strong>Alternative Case: Def=
ault address (Multiple addresses)</strong></h3>
<p local-id=3D"37e20eb48a74">The user opens the burger menu of a default ad=
dress for a partner with multiple addresses and clicks the Delete action. A=
 confirmation dialogue appears along with the option to replace the default=
 address. The user selects a new default address and confirms the deletion.=
<br><strong>Expected Result: </strong>The default address is updated, and t=
he deleted address is permanently removed and immediately disappears from t=
he overview.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"9d8c3e7d98ab" id=3D"id-03UserStory1-DeleteAddressData-Alter=
nativeCase:Onlyaddress"><strong>Alternative Case: Only address</strong></h3=
>
<p local-id=3D"04db419fc474">The user opens the burger menu of the only add=
ress for a partner and clicks the <strong>Delete</strong> action.<br>
A confirmation dialogue appears, and the user confirms the deletion.<br><st=
rong>Expected Result: </strong>The address is permanently deleted and immed=
iately disappears from the overview.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"d7e1fbe4-9022-464f-ae82-04feaa0bd466">
<h1 local-id=3D"3288c45b520e" id=3D"id-03UserStory1-DeleteAddressData-Narra=
tiveoftheUserStory:"><strong>Narrative of the User Story:</strong></h1>
<p local-id=3D"1cc76ca12904">Users can manage partner address information i=
n the Address Data section of the Partner module, where each address is dis=
played as a compact card with actions available via a burger menu. The Dele=
te action allows users to remove addresses that are incorrect, outdated, or=
 no longer required.</p>
<p local-id=3D"cb9405e6c256">When a user selects Delete, the system initiat=
es a confirmation process. For non=E2=80=91default addresses, a confirmatio=
n dialogue is shown indicating that the selected address will be permanentl=
y removed. The deletion is executed only after the user explicitly confirms=
 the action. If the user cancels, no changes are applied, and the address r=
emains unchanged.</p>
<p local-id=3D"eac4647715e6">If the address selected for deletion is the de=
fault address, the system prevents immediate deletion and prompts the user =
to select another address as the new default. Only after a new default addr=
ess is chosen can the deletion proceed, ensuring that a valid default addre=
ss is always maintained for the partner.</p>
<p local-id=3D"f82711cc9722">If the selected address is the only address fo=
r the partner, the system displays a confirmation message and executes the =
deletion only after explicit user confirmation.</p>
<p local-id=3D"f7ff48929e0b">Once confirmed, the deletion is irreversible. =
The address is immediately removed from the address overview, and the actio=
n is recorded as a new session/version in the Change History.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
------=_Part_14_1032477490.1778667058164--
